","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"Expand this section per type to override the server defaults for that type only:"},"280":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-40","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field         | Meaning                                                               |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Description` | Shown under the label in the dropdown and in the panel's option list. |","table":"table-1"},"281":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-41","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field      | Meaning                            |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `Category` | Category for tickets of this type. |","table":"table-1"},"282":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-42","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field         | Meaning                                     |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `Staff roles` | Roles that can manage tickets of this type. |","table":"table-1"},"283":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-43","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field         | Meaning                          |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `Admin roles` | Higher-tier roles for this type. |","table":"table-1"},"284":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-44","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                            | Meaning                         