ch on the ticket number, the opener's user ID, or the ticket subject (which is the\nsub-type label when the ticket came from a sub-type). Results are newest first, up to 200."},"449":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts-9","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts#searching","content":"Each result row shows:"},"450":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts-10","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts#searching","content":"`#<number>`"},"451":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts-11","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts#searching","content":"A status chip: `open`, `closed` or `deleted`"},"452":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts-12","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts#searching","content":"`<subject> · opener <user id> · <n> messages`"},"453":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts-13","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts#searching","content":"A button **Open** which opens the full HTML transcript in a new tab."},"454":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts-14","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts#searching","content":"A ticket is marked `deleted` once it has been closed and its channel removed, renamed or\narchived. The transcript itself is still there - `deleted` refers to the ticket channel, not the\ntranscript."},"455":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts-15","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts#searching","content":"Empty state: `No transcripts found.`"},"456":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts-16","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/transcripts#what-a-transcript-contains","content":"A header with the ticket number, 