-------- |\n| A panel shows `not posted` | Open it and press **Save changes** to post it to the channel. |","table":"table-0"},"895":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#dashboard","content":"| Symptom                         | Fix                                                            |\n| ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| A changed setting had no effect | You may not have pressed **Save settings** / **Save changes**. |","table":"table-0"},"896":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#dashboard","content":"| Symptom                          | Fix                                                                        |\n| -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| A panel/type value seems ignored | Panels and types override server defaults - check the panel and its types. |","table":"table-0"},"897":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#dashboard","content":"| Symptom          | Fix                                                                                 |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| The theme resets | The choice is stored per-browser; a different browser or a cleared cache resets it. |","table":"table-0"},"898":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#opening-tickets","content":"| Symptom                                      | Fix                                                                           |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Nothing happens when a user clicks the panel | Make sure the bot was invited with the permissions it asks for (Permissions). |","table":"table-1"},"899":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#opening-tickets","content":"| Symptom                                 | Fix                           |\n| --------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `You're not allowed to open tickets...` | The user is on the blacklist. |","table":"table-1"},"900":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#opening-tickets","content":"| Symptom                             | Fix                                                              |\n| ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `You already have N open ticket(s)` | Raise **Max open tickets per user** or have them close a ticket. |","table":"table-1"},"901":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#opening-tickets","content":"| Symptom                                     | Fix                                                                                                                      |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Sorry, I couldn't create your ticket: ...` | Usually a missing category or a permission problem in the ticket category. Check the category and the bot's permissions. |","table":"table-1"},"902":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#opening-tickets","content":"| Symptom                | Fix                                                                                                                    |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Panel shows no options | The panel has no ticket types, or you used **Buttons** style with more than 5 types. Use **Dropdown** for more than 5. |","table":"table-1"},"903":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#opening-tickets","content":"| Symptom                                  | Fix                                                                                                       |\n| ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| The second (sub-type) menu never appears | The type has no sub-types, or they failed to parse. Format is `emoji label \\| description`, one per line. |","table":"table-1"},"904":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#opening-tickets","content":"| Symptom                          | Fix                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Staff cannot see a thread ticket | Private threads are only visible to members and users with **Manage Threads**. Grant that permission or **Add User** the staff member - or switch the panel to `Private channel`. |","table":"table-1"},"905":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#staff-actions","content":"| Symptom             | Fix                                                                                  |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `Only staff can...` | You need **Manage Channels**, or a role listed in **Staff roles** / **Admin roles**. |","table":"table-2"},"906":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#staff-actions","content":"| Symptom                                        | Fix                                |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `You need the **Manage Server** permission...` | Same - the command is staff-gated. |","table":"table-2"},"907":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#staff-actions","content":"| Symptom                        | Fix                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `This channel isn't a ticket.` | The command only works inside a ticket channel that the bot created. |","table":"table-2"},"908":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#transcripts--closing","content":"| Symptom                       | Fix                                                                                                                        |\n| ----------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| No transcript posted on close | Set a **Transcript channel** (or **Log channel**). The transcript is still saved and reachable in the **Transcripts** tab. |","table":"table-3"},"909":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#transcripts--closing","content":"| Symptom                                 | Fix                                                                        |\n| --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Transcript is missing the last messages | Transcripts are capped at 2000 messages; very large tickets are truncated. |","table":"table-3"},"910":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#transcripts--closing","content":"| Symptom                         | Fix                                                                                         |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| The opener didn't get a DM copy | They have DMs closed. Turn on **DM the opener a copy** and/or check their privacy settings. |","table":"table-3"},"911":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#transcripts--closing","content":"| Symptom                    | Fix                                                                                                            |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Internal notes are missing | That's by design - notes are never in transcripts. They're posted to the log channel and stored on the ticket. |","table":"table-3"},"912":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting#transcripts--closing","content":"| Symptom                         | Fix                                                                                        |\n| ------------------------------- | -------------