ar** and **Banner** accept either a normal **image URL** (`https://...`) or a **data URI**\n(`data:image/png;base64,...`)."],[324,"**Avatar** and **Banner** are this server's profile images for the bot."],[325,"**Bio** is the bot's \"about me\" text in this server."],[675,"**Blacklist**\n: A list of users who cannot open tickets in a server."],[375,"**Blacklist** button"],[535,"**Blacklisted users** get an ephemeral \"You're not allowed to open tickets in this server\"\nmessage, with the reason if one was set."],[676,"**Bot profile**\n: The nickname, avatar, banner and bio the bot shows in one server, set on the server page. It does\nnot change the bot globally."],[677,"**Button panel**\n: A panel that shows one button per ticket type (max 5)."],[364,"**Buttons** - label, emoji and style for `claim`, `add`, `remove`, `rename` and `close`."],[272,"**Buttons** - one button per type. Discord allows **5** buttons per row, so the panel shows at\nmost **5** types in this mode."],[678,"**Channel ticket**\n: A private channel created for a single ticket."],[522,"**Channel tickets** are private. The bot sets permission overwrites so that:"],[679,"**Claim**\n: A staff member marking themselves as handling a ticket."],[369,"**Closing behaviour** - DM the opener a copy, delete the channel on close."],[807,"**Closing behaviour** (Customization → Closing behaviour): turn **Delete the channel on close**\noff if you want to keep the closed channel around. It is then renamed `closed-<number>`; the\ntranscript is saved either way."],[772,"**Create panel**."],[783,"**Create panel**."],[797,"**Create panel**."],[806,"**Create panel**."],[680,"**Customization**\n: The messages, colours, buttons and priorities that shape how tickets look and read. Set\nserver-wide, per panel, and per type."],[703,"**dat one ticketer** is a Discord ticketing bot. Users click a panel in your server, a private\nchannel or thread opens for them, and your staff manage it with buttons or slash commands. Every\nticket can be exported as an HTML transcript when it closes."],[303,"**Delete** - asks `Delete this panel and its message?`, removes the Discord message, and deletes\nthe panel and its types."],[681,"**Dropdown panel**\n: A panel that shows a select menu of ticket types (max 25)."],[271,"**Dropdown** - one select menu. Up to **25** ticket types. Best when you have several options."],[302,"**Duplicate** - copies the panel and all its types, then opens the copy so you can rename it."],[253,"**Edit** on a row opens `#/guild/<id>/panel/<pid>`"],[210,"**Footer**:"],[756,"**General settings**"],[787,"**General settings**"],[206,"**Header**, left to right:"],[682,"**Internal note**\n: A staff-only note on a ticket. Never shown to the opener and never included in transcripts."],[224,"**Invite the bot** in the top-right adds the bot to a new server."],[683,"**Log channel**\n: The channel that receives ticket activity and internal notes. Also used for transcripts when no\ntranscript channel is set."],[739,"**Login data** - if you sign in to the dashboard: your Discord user ID, username and avatar, held\nin a signed session cookie for the session."],[684,"**Max open tickets**\n: The per-user cap on open tickets. Staff bypass it, and a ticket type can add its own cap."],[366,"**Mention pings** - ping the opener, plus comma-separated role IDs to ping."],[590,"**never** shown to the opener or included in the transcript."],[323,"**Nickname** changes how the bot's name shows in this server only."],[686,"**Panel template**\n: A starting point in the new-panel editor - `Blank`, `Support`, `Sales`, `Report a user` or\n`Ban appeal`. It fills in the panel message and ticket types; everything stays editable."],[766,"**Panel**"],[775,"**Panel**"],[790,"**Panel**"],[800,"**Panel**"],[685,"**Panel**\n: A message in a channel with a dropdown or buttons that opens tickets."],[687,"**Placeholder**\n: A `{token}` in a text field that is replaced with a real value, e.g. `{username}`."],[365,"**