 thread."],[696,"**Transcript channel**\n: The channel where closed-ticket transcripts are posted. Falls back to the log channel, and the\ntranscript is always saved even if neither is set."],[462,"**Transcript channel**, if set;"],[368,"**Transcript embed** - colour, footer, title, description."],[695,"**Transcript**\n: A styled HTML copy of a ticket's messages, generated when the ticket closes."],[373,"**User ID** text box (placeholder `123456789012345678`)"],[363,"**Welcome message** - colour, title, message, footer, thumbnail URL, image URL, and a\n`Show \"Opened by\" line` checkbox."],[148,"`{name}` in the **Renamed** message and `{userAvatar}` in the welcome fields are the intended\nplaceholders for those spots. `{note}` in **Ticket closed** is filled with the **Transcript\nsaved** text."],[523,"`@everyone` cannot view the channel."],[504,"`/about` - brand, author, contact details and the wiki URL, plus **Add to a server** and **Wiki**\nlink buttons."],[472,"`/blacklist`"],[493,"`/config set` keys:"],[471,"`/config`"],[503,"`/help` - a short setup guide, a pointer to the buttons inside tickets, and an **Open the wiki**\nlink button."],[473,"`/help` and `/about`"],[556,"`/panel delete` removes a panel and its types (and its message)."],[555,"`/panel list` shows every panel with its ID, channel and mode."],[554,"`/panel resend` deletes the old message (if any) and posts a new one in the panel's channel."],[469,"`/panel`"],[505,"`/panel` and `/blacklist` are staff-gated. If someone without the right role runs them they get\n`You need the **Manage Server** permission to use this command.`"],[470,"`/ticket`"],[450,"`#<number>`"],[452,"`<subject> · opener <user id> · <n> messages`"],[404,"`Blank` · `Support` · `Sales` · `Report a user` · `Ban appeal`"],[794,"`Category for new tickets`: `Sales Tickets`."],[802,"`Channel to post in`: `#appeals`."],[777,"`Channel to post in`: `#report-a-user` (or a read-only info channel)."],[792,"`Channel to post in`: `#sales`."],[768